# Your library, not the repository's.
#
# Story files are copyrighted works and this repository is meant to be public, so none of them
# is tracked — not the ones in a fresh clone and not the ones you drop here. Put yours here and
# they appear in `/games`; the entry point also seeds the bundled Zork I into this directory on
# a bare start, and that copy is an artifact of the build.
#
# Only the sidecars are ours, and only they are tracked: `witness.z5` may sit beside
# `witness.md`, our commentary on what came in that game's box (spec 02 §4.5, spec 08 §1).
*
!*.md
!.gitignore
